# Kitchen UI Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the steps to build the Kitchen Management interface, which allows chefs to view and manage food orders in real-time.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Kitchen UI depends on **Firestore Collection Group Queries**. This may require an index to be created in the Firebase Console if it hasn't been created for the specific combination of status and orderedAt fields. I will implement the logic, and you may need to click the link provided in the browser console during initial testing to create the missing index.

